# 🗼 AETHERIA — DUNGEON SYSTEM

> **The Tower is not merely a dungeon.**
>
> **It is the final surviving structure between the Master and the end of the world.**
>
> Every floor contains a fragment of the world that once existed.
>
> Some floors are battlefields.
> Some are ruins.
> Some are cities.
> Some are forgotten civilizations.
> Some are memories of the world before its destruction.
>
> **To climb the Tower is to walk through the remains of Aetheria.**

---

# 1. DUNGEON SYSTEM OVERVIEW

The **Dungeon System** manages the entire Tower of Rebirth.

The Tower contains:

```text
100 FLOORS
```

The Tower is the primary progression path of the Master.

The system manages:

```text
Tower
Floor
Dungeon
Floor Environment
Floor Story
Floor Enemy
Floor Boss
Raid Boss
Multi-Party Floor
World Exploration
Pre-Destruction Exploration
Dungeon Mission
Floor Objective
Floor Event
Event Instance
Floor Reward
Floor State
Floor Difficulty
Destruction Level
Dungeon Completion
```

A Floor does not always require only one Party.

Some Floors are designed for:

```text
Single Party
Multiple Parties
Sequential Parties
Simultaneous Parties
Main Party + Support Party
Raid Formation
```

The required Party structure depends on the Floor's mission, environment, event, and Boss mechanics.

