# 8. WORLD EXPLORATION SYSTEM

The Dungeon System contains a special feature:

# **World Exploration**

World Exploration represents the world of Aetheria **before its destruction**.

This is different from exploring the ruined Tower environment.

The Master can access historical or reconstructed versions of locations.

