# 11. EXPLORATION MODEL

The system can represent two states of the same location.

```text
BEFORE DESTRUCTION
        │
        ▼
WORLD EXPLORATION
        │
        ▼
HISTORICAL LOCATION
        │
        ▼
NIGHT OF RUIN
        │
        ▼
CURRENT WORLD
        │
        ▼
RUINED LOCATION
```

Example:

```text
ELYSIUM

Before:
Grand Capital
      ↓
Night of Ruin
      ↓
Destruction
      ↓
Tower Fragment
      ↓
Current Exploration
```

This allows the player to understand what was lost.

