# 21. FLOOR COMPLETION

A Floor is considered completed when its required objective has been fulfilled.

For a Single-Party Floor:

```text
Floor 12
   ↓
Main Objective Complete
   ↓
Boss Defeated
   ↓
Victory
   ↓
Floor Clear
```

For a Multi-Party Floor:

```text
Floor 36
   ↓
Party 1 Objective Complete
   ↓
Party 2 Objective Complete
   ↓
Shared Objective Complete
   ↓
Boss Defeated
   ↓
Victory
   ↓
Floor Clear
```

The Master can then unlock the next progression.

