# 26. PARALLEL PARTY FLOOR

In a Parallel Floor, multiple Parties act at the same time.

Example:

```text
FLOOR 36 — THE FALLING CITADEL

Party 1:
Defend the western gate.

Party 2:
Protect the evacuation route.

Party 3:
Destroy the corruption core.

All objectives must be completed
before the Citadel collapses.
```

Flow:

```text
PARTY 1 ACTION
      │
PARTY 2 ACTION
      │
PARTY 3 ACTION
      │
      ▼
SHARED FLOOR STATE
      │
      ▼
EVENT RESULT
```

Failure of one Party can affect the other Parties.

---

# 27. SEQUENTIAL PARTY FLOOR

In a Sequential Floor, Parties enter one after another.

Example:

```text
Party 1:
Break through the outer defense.

Party 2:
Enter the inner fortress.

Party 3:
Defeat the final guardian.
```

Flow:

```text
PARTY 1 COMPLETE
      ↓
PARTY 2 UNLOCKED
      ↓
PARTY 2 COMPLETE
      ↓
PARTY 3 UNLOCKED
      ↓
FINAL OBJECTIVE
```

The result of the previous Party can affect the next Party.

---

