# 37. RAID BOSS SYSTEM

The Dungeon System supports:

# **RAID BOSS**

Raid Bosses are large-scale encounters requiring greater preparation than normal Bosses.

A Raid Boss can require:

```text
Multiple Parties
Multiple Heroes
Special Formation
Special Objectives
Special Mechanics
Extended Battle
